Scenario "submitted_commands_scrollback"
Command "CARGO_BIN_EXE_maqi"
Terminal rows 4 cols 24
Cursor row 4 col 1

Step "show the prompt at the bottom"
WaitFrontendLineStartsWith "maqi>" timeout 5000ms
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |························|
  r01 |························|
  r02 |························|
  r03 |maqi>···················|

Step "submit the first command"
Input "echo one"
Input enter
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |························|
  r01 |maqi>·echo·one··········|
  r02 |echo·one················|
  r03 |maqi>···················|

Step "submit the second command"
Input "echo two"
Input enter
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |echo·one················|
  r01 |maqi>·echo·two··········|
  r02 |echo·two················|
  r03 |maqi>···················|

Step "scroll back to both commands"
Scroll up 1
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·echo·one··········|
  r01 |echo·one················|
  r02 |maqi>·echo·two··········|
  r03 |echo·two················|

Step "return to the current prompt"
Scroll down 1
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |echo·one················|
  r01 |maqi>·echo·two··········|
  r02 |echo·two················|
  r03 |maqi>···················|
